# Base URL of the NER-LandslideAI backend (FastAPI).
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (or `.env`) and adjust as needed.
#
# Local development (default used by the app when unset):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Notes:
# - The frontend never fabricates data. If the backend is unreachable,
#   the UI renders explicit offline / empty states.
# - When the UI is served over HTTPS, the backend URL must also be HTTPS
#   (browsers block mixed content).
